WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.933
This video shows an order placed through the UI in America/Chicago shows the browser clock's time on My orders. Ticket BUG-42: My orders shows the time an order was placed in UTC, not the shopper's own time.

2
00:00:13.933 --> 00:00:16.867
Open the home page

3
00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:20.133
Click the Sign in link

4
00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:23.400
The Login heading is shown.

5
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.000
Type “alice” into the Username field

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.933
Type the Password (hidden)

7
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.867
Click the Login button

8
00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:36.133
The Account button is shown.

9
00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:39.067
Open the Item page

10
00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:43.000
The Explorer 45L Backpack heading is shown.

11
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.600
Click the Add to basket button

12
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:50.200
The shopping bag link is shown.

13
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.467
Added Explorer 45L Backpack to the shopping bag

14
00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:57.733
The Checkout heading is shown.

15
00:00:57.733 --> 00:01:02.000
Browser time zone America/Chicago: before = 11/20/2026 18:56:50

16
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.933
Reload the Orders page

17
00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:08.867
Order placed; after = 11/20/2026 18:56:56 (America/Chicago)

18
00:01:08.867 --> 00:01:12.467
The My orders link is shown.

19
00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:18.400
Now on the Orders page. 1 item is shown. “11/20/2026 18:56:55” is shown.

20
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.333
Reload the Orders page

21
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:24.267
“11/20/2026 18:56:55” is shown.

22
00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:28.867
Window 11/20/2026 18:56:50 .. 11/20/2026 18:56:56; UTC 11/21/2026 00:56:55

23
00:01:28.867 --> 00:01:33.800
Placed order shows 11/20/2026 18:56:55 (America/Chicago), not 11/21/2026 00:56:55 UTC

24
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:41.733
Result: an order placed through the UI in America/Chicago shows the browser clock's time on My orders, as expected.
